<title>UK: LME lists Indian tin brand.</title>
<headline>LME lists Indian tin brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has listed the HAMCO tin brand which will constitute good delivery with immediate effect, an Exchange notice to all members said.</p>
<p>Producer Hamco Mining and Smelting Ltd based in Bombay will have an annual output of around 10,000 tonnes of refined tin at its Kherdi (Silvassa) smelter in the Union Territory of Dadra and Nagar Haveli. --London Newsroom +44 171 542-8075</p>
</text>
